      "value": "@{5f2cba5631807b34c94a38e1|full_name}: the multiple messages thing could be like how roblox does it, with 3 messages shown at once, and any others are visible via a chat history, which only shows in a dedicated ui.\ni think itd be better if the chat box was able to rotate positionally around the avatar in a cylinder shape.",
